{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "网站瘫痪了  (Websites Overloaded)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the control room before the broadcast, Kaiwen and Xingzi check online traffic as Xin Huimei's fans flood her record label's website in protest. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "干什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "辛惠美粉丝疯了，都在网上刷屏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我知道，原野的官方网站都被挤爆了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "留言全都是抗议。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "同一时间访问量过大，七个钟头没恢复过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好几个关联公司的网站全都瘫痪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要不是老大一直不出声，今晚星天的网站也得挂了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要是影响到直播就坏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "看他这么忍着，我都替他胃疼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大该吃胃药了，昨晚肯定没睡好。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "干什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you looking at?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "辛惠美粉丝疯了，都在网上刷屏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei's fans have gone wild and flooded every screen online.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我知道，原野的官方网站都被挤爆了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know; Yuanye's official website crashed from the traffic.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "留言全都是抗议。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every single comment is a protest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "同一时间访问量过大，七个钟头没恢复过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Traffic at the same moment was too heavy, and it stayed down for seven hours.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好几个关联公司的网站全都瘫痪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Several related company websites have all gone down completely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要不是老大一直不出声，今晚星天的网站也得挂了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Had our boss not kept quiet all along, Xingtian's site would have crashed tonight too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要是影响到直播就坏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If it affected the live broadcast, we would be in real trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "看他这么忍着，我都替他胃疼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Watching him hold everything in like this makes my own stomach ache for him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大该吃胃药了，昨晚肯定没睡好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss needs his stomach medicine; he clearly slept poorly last night.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "干什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "辛惠美粉丝疯了，都在网上刷屏了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我知道，原野的官方网站都被挤爆了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "留言全都是抗议。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "同一时间访问量过大，七个钟头没恢复过来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好几个关联公司的网站全都瘫痪了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要不是老大一直不出声，今晚星天的网站也得挂了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要是影响到直播就坏了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "看他这么忍着，我都替他胃疼。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大该吃胃药了，昨晚肯定没睡好。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao's silence spared Xingtian's website ahead of the live show, though the stress is taking a toll on his health. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
